# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# sdkwork-agents-apps 仓库根忽略规则
#
# 本仓库原为 sdkwork-agents 仓库的 apps/ 子树，独立成仓库后原父仓库的
# .gitignore 不再对本仓库生效，故此处平移了父仓库规则中适用于本子树的部分
# （路径前缀 apps/ 已去除），并补齐 Flutter / HarmonyOS 产物规则。
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- 环境变量文件 ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
!sdkwork-agents-h5/.env.standalone.*
!sdkwork-agents-h5/.env.cloud.*

# --- 依赖目录 ---
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/.pnpm-store/

# --- 构建产物 ---
dist/
**/dist/
build/
**/build/
coverage/
**/coverage/
artifacts/
**/artifacts/
**/test-results/
*.tsbuildinfo
**/.cache/
.turbo/
**/.turbo/

# --- Flutter / Dart ---
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies

# --- HarmonyOS / DevEco ---
**/oh_modules/
**/.hvigor/
**/.cxx/

# --- Python ---
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- 本地配置与运行时状态 ---
*.local.toml
config/*.local.toml
**/.runtime/
**/.sdkwork/local/
**/.sdkwork/secrets/
**/.sdkwork/cache/
**/.sdkwork/tmp/
**/.sdkwork/dart/pub-cache/
**/.sdkwork/manual-backups/
**/*.bootstrap.local.json

# --- 数据库与日志 ---
*.log
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal

# --- OS / IDE ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.revert-merge
